<title>MEXICO: Apasco Q1 net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Apasco Q1 net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		    0.28			 1.24</p>
<p>     Oper Income	106.68 million	     274.63 million</p>
<p>     Net		   78.48 million	     344.74 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 825.26 million	     959.44 million</p>
<p>     Gross profit     184.30 million	     367.65 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain     6.60 million	     165.82 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid     56.33 million		62.49 million</p>
<p>	    FX loss	 9.66 million     gain   51.27 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned   22.95 million		23.97 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain     49.63 million	     153.07 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Apasco SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9560))</p>
